{{!-- track-card — NSDS's .ns-trackcard: one TRAINING SECTION, as a step.

     Same data as a path card, deliberately different shape. A course is a
     destination — you pick one — so its card leads with a glyph. A training
     section is a step in an order, so its card leads with a NUMERAL. That
     difference is the information, not decoration, and it is why both
     components exist rather than one with a modifier.

     PARAMETERS
       index   the numeral — pass {{@number}} from the foreach --}}
<a class="ns-trackcard" href="{{url}}">
    <span class="ns-trackcard__head">
        <span class="ns-trackcard__icon">{{#primary_tag}}{{> "internal/topic-icon"}}{{/primary_tag}}</span>
        <span class="ns-trackcard__index">{{#match index "<" 10}}0{{/match}}{{index}}</span>
    </span>
    <span class="ns-trackcard__title">{{title}}</span>
    {{#if excerpt}}<span class="ns-trackcard__text">{{excerpt}}</span>{{/if}}
    <span class="ns-trackcard__meta">
        <span class="sp-duration sp-optional">{{~> "internal/duration"~}}</span>
        <span class="sp-optional">{{~> "internal/level"~}}</span>
    </span>
</a>
